a:2:{s:7:"content";s:3456:"<p>In an era where customers can book a hotel room with just a few taps, having a professional booking website is no longer an option, but a must. That’s why BOOKDE was created – a platform designed to build optimized hotel booking websites for modern accommodation businesses.</p>
<p><strong>What is BOOKDE?</strong><br />
BOOKDE is a brand specializing in providing hotel, homestay, and resort website design solutions with a modern interface, featuring full functionality from online booking and payment to room management.</p>
<p>With the motto “Easy booking – Professional management – Revenue growth,” BOOKDE is not only a website design service but also a companion for hotels in their digital transformation journey.</p>
<p><strong>Key Features of BOOKDE</strong><br />
🌐 <strong>OTA-Standard Interface – Optimized User Experience</strong><br />
Modern design, compatible with computers, mobile phones, and tablets.<br />
The interface resembles OTAs like Agoda and Booking.com, making it easy for users to get familiar with.<br />
Easily customize logos and colors according to brand identity.</p>
<p>📅 <strong>Online Booking &amp; Room Management</strong><br />
Users can select dates, view available rooms, make bookings, and receive email confirmations.<br />
Manage room availability in real-time to avoid booking conflicts.<br />
Supports managing multiple room types, quantities, and flexible pricing.</p>
<p>💳<strong>Integrated Online Payment</strong><br />
Supports payments via bank cards, e-wallets, QR codes, etc.<br />
Safe, secure, and convenient for both customers and hotel owners.</p>
<p>🔄 <strong>Connect with Major OTAs (Optional)</strong><br />
BOOKDE supports API integration with platforms like Booking.com, Agoda, Traveloka, etc., through third-party Channel Managers.<br />
Synchronize room availability and prices between the website and OTAs, optimizing room sales channels.</p>
<p>📈 <strong>Detailed Statistics &amp; Reports</strong><br />
Manage revenue, occupancy rates, booking sources, etc.<br />
Helps hotels make accurate business decisions.</p>
<p><strong>Who is BOOKDE for?</strong></p>
<p>Small to medium-sized hotels looking to professionalize their online booking channels.</p>
<p>Homestays, villas, and resorts needing an attractive and user-friendly website to reach customers directly.</p>
<p>Travel startups seeking to build an internal OTA system.</p>
<p><strong>Why Choose BOOKDE?</strong><br />
✅ Fast &amp; Flexible – A complete website within days, easily scalable according to needs.<br />
✅ SEO &amp; Speed Optimization – Helps you effectively reach customers on Google.<br />
✅ High Security &amp; Long-term Support – BOOKDE commits to 24/7 technical support.<br />
✅ Affordable – Multiple service packages suitable for different types of accommodations.</p>
<p><strong>Conclusion</strong><br />
In the fierce competition of the hospitality industry, BOOKDE is the key to optimizing direct room booking channels, saving OTA fees, enhancing your brand, and boosting revenue.</p>
<p>👉 If you’re looking for a professional, easy-to-use website solution that drives business results – let BOOKDE be your partner!</p>
